  "releaseNotes": "Unreleased:\n- Unified expression translation: all SQL predicate translation is now handled by a single SqlPredicateTranslator (non-generic, alias/paramPrefix-configurable). PredicateVisitor<TEntity> is a thin typed wrapper. IncludeFilterTranslator removed.\n- Fix: AsSplitQuery Include/ThenInclude Where filters were silently ignored; now applied as parameterised AND clauses in every generated IN-query.\n\nv2.2.0:\n- BulkInsertAsync and BulkMergeAsync with automatic per-dialect batching.\n- Include/ThenInclude now accept a Where filter predicate.",
